      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "state": "accepted",
      "rejection_reason": null,
      "text_sr": "Ne mogu da pretvorim Observerovu promenu parkinga sa 250 na 467 u dokaz da su automobili odlazili tokom očitavanja vazduha: Parking Servis ne objavljuje vreme merenja. Takođe ne mogu da sinhronizujem grad prema starosti prijema: podaci Sensor.Community stigli su pre 18 min, a SEPA pre 58 min, što ne utvrđuje ni istovremeno merenje ni zajednički uzrok. [F11][F12][F10][F2]",
      "text_en": "I cannot turn Observer's parking change from 250 to 467 into evidence of cars leaving during the air readings: Parking Servis publishes no measurement time [F11][F12]. I also cannot synchronize the city by reception age: Sensor.Community arrived 18 min ago and SEPA 58 min ago, which establishes neither simultaneous measurement nor a shared cause [F10][F2].",
