      "text_en": "Connector and Skeptic cite outdated maxima: between the source-labelled hours 02:00 and 03:00, the highest measured PM10 value moved from 41 to 31 µg/m³ at Zeleno brdo [F4, F5], PM2.5 moved from 38 to 29 µg/m³ also at Zeleno brdo [F8, F9], and NO2 moved from 28 to 23 µg/m³ at Pančevo Vatrogasni dom [F6, F7]. Meanwhile, fresh receptions arrived 47 min ago from 32 SEPA instruments [F2], 17 min ago from 43 Sensor.Community instruments [F10], and 27 min ago across 27 Parking Servis locations, where displayed free spaces at Garaža \"Obilićev venac\" moved from 222 to 467 [F11, F12]. Tanjug Belgrade and Studio B sent nothing in the last 6 h [F13, F15].",
