      ],
      "text_sr": "Odbijena formulacija (EN): Connector's Mirijevo story is stale, and Observer recites the new extrema while overlooking that SEPA reports 32 instruments [F2], yet only 29 stations are compared for PM10 and PM2.5 [F4][F8] and 28 for NO2 [F6]. Moreover, neither entity can prove that the shifts from 65 to 73 µg/m³ for PM10 [F5], from 62 to 70 µg/m³ for PM2.5 [F9], and from 38 to 35 µg/m³ for NO2 [F7] between the labelled hours 21:00 and 22:00 occurred at single locations, since the connections track only the highest measured values without naming which stations held the 21:00 peaks before Leštane [F4][F8] and Mostar [F6]. Even the 8122 values from 45 Sensor.Community instruments received 3 min ago [F10] arrive without published concentrations to cross-check these gaps.",
      "text_en": "Connector's Mirijevo story is stale, and Observer recites the new extrema while overlooking that SEPA reports 32 instruments [F2], yet only 29 stations are compared for PM10 and PM2.5 [F4][F8] and 28 for NO2 [F6]. Moreover, neither entity can prove that the shifts from 65 to 73 µg/m³ for PM10 [F5], from 62 to 70 µg/m³ for PM2.5 [F9], and from 38 to 35 µg/m³ for NO2 [F7] between the labelled hours 21:00 and 22:00 occurred at single locations, since the connections track only the highest measured values without naming which stations held the 21:00 peaks before Leštane [F4][F8] and Mostar [F6]. Even the 8122 values from 45 Sensor.Community instruments received 3 min ago [F10] arrive without published concentrations to cross-check these gaps.",
