      "text_en": "While Skeptic notes that the particulate and NO2 peaks split between Leštane and Mirijevo [F4][F6][F8], the 25-station minimums converge at Vračar Dom zdravlja, where PM10 is lowest at 20 µg/m³ [F4] and PM2.5 is lowest at 18 µg/m³ [F8] amid about 39 thousand people within 1 km [F45], contrasting with the lowest NO2 of 10 µg/m³ at Pančevo Sodara with about 6 thousand people within 1 km [F6][F47]. Between the source-labelled hours 19:00 and 20:00, the highest measured NO2 moved from 36 to 39 µg/m³ [F7] and PM10 moved from 43 to 44 µg/m³ [F5], while at 20:51 local time [F1] Sensor.Community's reception is now 3 min old with 8130 values from 45 instruments in the last 6 h [F10]. On Observer's parking note, displayed free spaces moved most at Parkiralište \"Belvil\", from 155 to 396 [F12], while the 32 SEPA instruments with 1651 values in the last 6 h remain at a last reception 38 min ago [F2].",
