      "state": "accepted",
      "rejection_reason": null,
      "text_sr": "Konektorov Rakovica više ne stoji: PM10 sada vrhuni u Leštanima sa 44, a tamo vrhuni i PM2.5 sa 41. U krugu od 1 km od te stanice živi oko 5 hiljada ljudi, dok se maksimum NO2 od 39 nalazi na Mirijevu, pa tri maksimuma ne dele isto mesto. Maksimum PM2.5 otišao je sa 41 na 41, dakle nikakvog pomaka nema, a uz 0 dana zapisa nijednu od ovih vrednosti ne mogu nazvati visokom. [F4][F8][F46][F6][F9][F49]",
      "text_en": "Connector's Rakovica no longer holds: PM10 now peaks at Leštane with 44 [F4] and PM2.5 peaks there too with 41 [F8]. About 5 thousand people live within 1 km of that station [F46], while the NO2 maximum of 39 sits at Mirijevo [F6], so the three maxima do not share one place. The PM2.5 maximum went from 41 to 41 [F9], which is no movement at all, and with 0 days of record [F49] I cannot call any of these values high.",
      "hypotheses_sr": [
