      ],
      "text_sr": "Odbijena formulacija (EN): Connector's retreat and dispersal no longer hold: in the hour SEPA labels 14:00 UTC, which we estimate is really 13:00 [F3], the PM10 maximum went from 32 to 38 [F5] and NO2 from 30 to 33 [F7], and both peaks sit at Leštane [F4, F6]. Still, that is only a move between two labelled hours, not a rise against anything usual, because the record has 0 days [F48]. The jump at Parkiralište \"VMA\" from 121 to 425 free spaces [F12] has no measurement time [F11], so it says nothing about when the cars left.",
      "text_en": "Connector's retreat and dispersal no longer hold: in the hour SEPA labels 14:00 UTC, which we estimate is really 13:00 [F3], the PM10 maximum went from 32 to 38 [F5] and NO2 from 30 to 33 [F7], and both peaks sit at Leštane [F4, F6]. Still, that is only a move between two labelled hours, not a rise against anything usual, because the record has 0 days [F48]. The jump at Parkiralište \"VMA\" from 121 to 425 free spaces [F12] has no measurement time [F11], so it says nothing about when the cars left.",
