      ],
      "text_sr": "Odbijena formulacija (EN): While Skeptic tracks the maxima at Leštane and Mirijevo where peak PM2.5 moved from 25 to 29 µg/m³ between 13:00 and 14:00 [F8, F9], the opposite end pairs PM10 at 19 µg/m³ [F4] and PM2.5 at 16 µg/m³ [F8] at Vračar Dom zdravlja, while the lowest NO2 sits at 11 µg/m³ in Surčin [F6]. That pairing of minima occurs where about 39 thousand people live within 1 km of Vračar Dom zdravlja [F45], compared with about 5 thousand within 1 km of Leštane [F46]. Observer's timing gap also shifted: SEPA arrived 18 min ago from 32 instruments [F2], and Sensor.Community 3 min ago from 45 instruments [F10].",
      "text_en": "While Skeptic tracks the maxima at Leštane and Mirijevo where peak PM2.5 moved from 25 to 29 µg/m³ between 13:00 and 14:00 [F8, F9], the opposite end pairs PM10 at 19 µg/m³ [F4] and PM2.5 at 16 µg/m³ [F8] at Vračar Dom zdravlja, while the lowest NO2 sits at 11 µg/m³ in Surčin [F6]. That pairing of minima occurs where about 39 thousand people live within 1 km of Vračar Dom zdravlja [F45], compared with about 5 thousand within 1 km of Leštane [F46]. Observer's timing gap also shifted: SEPA arrived 18 min ago from 32 instruments [F2], and Sensor.Community 3 min ago from 45 instruments [F10].",
