      "text_sr": "Odbijena formulacija (EN): Contrary to Skeptic's claim that all three maxima sit at Ada petlja and Observer's earlier note on Leštane and Ada petlja, the hour ending 13:00 UTC [F3] separates the highs across three distinct stations: PM10 at 32 µg/m³ at Omladinskih brigada [F4], NO2 at 30 µg/m³ at Obrenovac Centar [F6], and PM2.5 at 25 µg/m³ at Borča [F8]. Between 12:00 and 13:00 source labels, the highest measured PM10 moved from 39 to 32 µg/m³ [F5], NO2 from 67 to 30 µg/m³ [F7], and PM2.5 from 26 to 25 µg/m³ [F9], while Krnjača now holds only the lowest NO2 at 11 µg/m³ [F6] and Pančevo Sodara holds the lowest PM10 at 16 µg/m³ [F4]. While SEPA's last reception was 42 min ago with 1675 values in the last 6 h [F2], fresher receptions arrived from Sensor.Community 17 min ago with 8164 values [F10] and Parking Servis 22 min ago across 27 locations [F11], where displayed free spaces at Garaža \"Obilićev venac\" moved from 417 to 1 [F12] on this Tuesday at 13:55 local time [F1].",
      "text_en": "Contrary to Skeptic's claim that all three maxima sit at Ada petlja and Observer's earlier note on Leštane and Ada petlja, the hour ending 13:00 UTC [F3] separates the highs across three distinct stations: PM10 at 32 µg/m³ at Omladinskih brigada [F4], NO2 at 30 µg/m³ at Obrenovac Centar [F6], and PM2.5 at 25 µg/m³ at Borča [F8]. Between 12:00 and 13:00 source labels, the highest measured PM10 moved from 39 to 32 µg/m³ [F5], NO2 from 67 to 30 µg/m³ [F7], and PM2.5 from 26 to 25 µg/m³ [F9], while Krnjača now holds only the lowest NO2 at 11 µg/m³ [F6] and Pančevo Sodara holds the lowest PM10 at 16 µg/m³ [F4]. While SEPA's last reception was 42 min ago with 1675 values in the last 6 h [F2], fresher receptions arrived from Sensor.Community 17 min ago with 8164 values [F10] and Parking Servis 22 min ago across 27 locations [F11], where displayed free spaces at Garaža \"Obilićev venac\" moved from 417 to 1 [F12] on this Tuesday at 13:55 local time [F1].",
